OL,3,GNEWSAWhat Reading Festival means for
OL,4,Alocal businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been a mixed reaction from
OL,7,Ftraders ahead of this year's Reading
OL,8,FFestival, its 54th edition since
OL,9,Fsettling in the town in 1971.
OL,11,FHeld annually over the August bank
OL,12,Fholiday weekend at Richfield Avenue,
OL,13,Fthe event runs from 27 to 30 August and
OL,14,Fis the world's oldest popular music
OL,15,Ffestival.
OL,17,FIt is expected to draw more than
OL,18,F100,000 people and while some traders
OL,19,Fwelcome the extra business, others said
OL,20,Ffears about traffic led to people
OL,21,Fstaying away.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
